---
import PlacePage from '../components/PlacePage.astro';
---

<PlacePage
  lang="en"
  currentPath="/what-we-do"
  title="What we do"
  image="/places/bellas-artes.jpg"
  place="Palacio de Bellas Artes"
  country="Mexico"
  credit="Diego Delso, CC BY-SA 3.0"
  creditHref="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Palacio_de_Bellas_Artes,_M%C3%A9xico_D.F.,_M%C3%A9xico,_2013-10-13,_DD_40.jpg"
>
  <h1 slot="sheet">One service, three parts.</h1>
  <p>Rails connect a client's volume to local acquiring in Latin America, on a local commercial policy. The Website Factory digitises local merchants in the geographies where we have structure. Settlement takes the money collected locally out to the client.</p>
  <h2>What we refuse</h2>
  <p>We do not take our clients' merchants. We do not dispute their accounts. We do not do fulfilment or shipping. Only the rails, the Website Factory, and the settlement that takes money out. Two niches, no conflict of interest.</p>
  <div class="cards">
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__bar" style="background:#1C3D4A"></span>
      <h2><a href="/acquirers">Rails</a></h2>
      <p>Infrastructure that connects a client's volume to local acquiring in Latin America, on a local commercial policy: local prices, local payment methods, the best approval we can get.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__bar" style="background:#C2412D"></span>
      <h2>Website Factory</h2>
      <p>Digitisation for local merchants in the geographies where we have structure, from the CNPJ through operational management with the local entities, until payout.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__bar" style="background:#C4890A"></span>
      <h2>Settlement</h2>
      <p>Money collected locally reaches the client with the fewest hops. Nothing moves before the book ties.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</PlacePage>
